{"seq":2,"slug":"personal-automation","title":"个人自动化工程","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 个人自动化工程 简介\n\n个人自动化工程是将软件工程中的自动化理念应用于个人生产力系统的实践学科。它不仅关注单一工具的使用技巧，更强调如何构建一套完整的、可维护的自动化体系，让重复性工作从日常中彻底消失。在 2026 年，随着 AI Agent、低代码平台和系统级自动化工具的成熟，个人自动化已从\"锦上添花\"演变为知识工作者的核心竞争力。\n\n本知识库面向有一定技术背景的开发者和效率爱好者，系统性地覆盖从桌面启动器到云端工作流编排的完整自动化栈。无论你是希望深度定制 Raycast 扩展的 macOS 用户，还是想用 n8n 搭建私有自动化平台的全栈工程师，都能在这里找到从零到精通的路径。\n\n第一章**启动器自动化**深入探讨以 Raycast 和 Alfred 为代表的桌面启动器生态，包括扩展开发、Workflow 设计和快速操作系统的构建方法。第二章**工作流编排**聚焦 n8n、Zapier、Make 等平台的实战应用，涵盖本地部署、场景设计和自定义 API 连接器的开发。第三章**系统级自动化**介绍 Apple Shortcuts、Hammerspoon、Keyboard Maestro 等工具在操作系统层面的深度集成，以及文件系统自动化的最佳实践。第四章**自动化哲学**从方法论层面提供 ROI 评估框架、自动化阶梯模型和长期维护策略。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从第四章的自动化哲学建立正确的思维框架，再根据自身平台选择第一章或第三章的系统级工具入手，最后进入第二章的工作流编排实现跨系统联动。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"launcher-automation","title":"启动器自动化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"raycast-deep-customization","title":"Raycast 深度定制","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation/raycast-deep-customization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alfred-workflows","title":"Alfred Workflows 实战","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation/alfred-workflows"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quick-action-system-design","title":"快速操作系统设计","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation/quick-action-system-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"workflow-orchestration","title":"工作流编排","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/workflow-orchestration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"n8n-local-deployment","title":"n8n 本地部署与编排","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/workflow-orchestration/n8n-local-deployment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"zapier-make-scenario-design","title":"Zapier 与 Make 场景设计","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/workflow-orchestration/zapier-make-scenario-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-connector-development","title":"API 连接器开发","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/workflow-orchestration/api-connector-development"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-level-automation","title":"系统级自动化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"apple-shortcuts-advanced","title":"Apple Shortcuts 高级用法","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/apple-shortcuts-advanced"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hammerspoon-keyboard-maestro","title":"Hammerspoon 与 Keyboard Maestro","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/hammerspoon-keyboard-maestro"},{"seq":3,"slug":"filesystem-automation","title":"文件系统自动化","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/filesystem-automation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"automation-philosophy","title":"自动化哲学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/automation-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"roi-evaluation-framework","title":"ROI 评估框架","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/automation-philosophy/roi-evaluation-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automation-ladder-model","title":"自动化阶梯模型","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/automation-philosophy/automation-ladder-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maintenance-reliability","title":"维护与可靠性","url":"/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/automation-philosophy/maintenance-reliability"}]}]}